## 1. Every entry point to connecting / scanning

**Navigations to `AppRoutes.bleScan` (`/ble/scan`) — 2 call sites:**

| Site | file:line | Trigger |
|---|---|---|
| Device tab | `/home/jinsc/Desktop_My/work/my_work/sifli/02_sw/flutter/lib/ui/device/device_page.dart:33` | `_scan()` → `await Get.toNamed(AppRoutes.bleScan)` |
| Lab/home page | `/home/jinsc/Desktop_My/work/my_work/sifli/02_sw/flutter/lib/ui/home/home_controller.dart:141` | `openBleScan()` → `await Get.toNamed(AppRoutes.bleScan)` |

`openBleScan()` (`home_controller.dart:131-143`) pre-flights permissions itself, then opens the page and calls `refreshStatus()` on return.

**Navigations to `AppRoutes.companionDebug` (`/ble/companion`) — 2 sites:**
- `/home/jinsc/Desktop_My/work/my_work/sifli/02_sw/flutter/lib/ui/home/home_controller.dart:159` — `openCompanionDebug()` (same permission pre-flight shape).
- `/home/jinsc/Desktop_My/work/my_work/sifli/02_sw/flutter/lib/main.dart:82-85` — dev-only cold start: `const bool.fromEnvironment('COMPANION_DEBUG')` decides `initialRoute`.

Route table (no Bindings on either page): `/home/jinsc/Desktop_My/work/my_work/sifli/02_sw/flutter/lib/app/app_pages.dart:49-56`.

**What the user actually taps:**
- Device tab (`tab = 1.obs`, and 1 is the *default* tab — `shell_controller.dart:22`):
  - header "+" icon: `device_page.dart:158-165` `IconButton(onPressed: _scan, tooltip: LocaleKeys.add, icon: Icons.add_circle_outline)`.
  - the round action button when not ready: `device_page.dart:218-236` `onPressed: controller.syncing.value ? null : (ready ? _sync : _scan)`, label = `deviceConnect` ("连接码表") when disconnected.
- Lab page (reached by long-pressing the version row in Settings, `settings_page.dart:226`): `home_page.dart:88-92` `FilledButton.icon(onPressed: controller.openBleScan, icon: Icons.bluetooth_searching, label: homeBleScan "扫描蓝牙设备")`.
- Nothing else navigates to the scan page. No page auto-opens it: every "need connect" guard just shows a snack (`deviceNeedConnect` / `otaNeedBle` / `ephNeedBle` / `coredumpNeedBle` / `gpxNeedBle` / `notifUploadNeedBle`) and returns.
- `DevicePage._openDevice` (`device_page.dart:104-113`) is the reuse-guard for sub-pages (eph) that need a live link.

## 2. `lib/ui/device/device_page.dart` (468 lines)

`class DevicePage extends GetView<ShellController>` (line 25) — it **hard-depends on `ShellController`** (GetView does `Get.find`). The controller is only bound on the home route (`/home/jinsc/.../lib/ui/shell/shell_binding.dart:8`, `Get.lazyPut(ShellController.new, fenix: true)` attached at `app_pages.dart:42`).

Structure: `SafeArea` → `Obx` (line 118) → `ListView`:
1. `HelmTitleRow(title: tabDevice, trailing: IconButton(_scan))` — lines 158-165.
2. Hero row: `HelmPulseGlow(active: ready)` wrapping `AppAssets.bikeComputer` 132x132 (line 171-179), then a column with device name / status line / battery detail / action button (182-237).
3. Sync meter card when `controller.syncing.value` (243-253).
4. `deviceIdleHint` when `!ready && !connecting` (254-265).
5. Status chips (REC / moving / GNSS / HR / CSC / CPS / MTP busy) when `ready` (266-315).
