Plain `StatefulWidget` (no controller, no Binding). State: `Map<String, ScanResult> _devices` keyed by `remoteId.str`, `_scanSub`, `_isScanningSub`, `_scanning`, `_error`, `_filterCompanion = true` (lines 29-37).

